      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Security & Prevention",
      "items": [
        "Redeem transaction verifies code existence and prevents self-pairing",
        "Expired or already-linked invites are rejected immediately with user-friendly retry states"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Mutual Synchronization",
      "items": [
        "Firestore document state transitions atomically to PAIRED",
